        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "<p=1>Rhine Lab Observation Station, Kjerag</><p=2>Two months ago</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_both",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#7$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was fast... an observation station of this size, built in such a short period of time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Business must have cried tears of blood when they approved the budget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, we got more sponsorship offers from financial institutions than we could handle the moment the committee approved the Kjerag observation station.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "If anything, funding was the least of our worries on this project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, Silence... I didn't expect the committee to approve the proposal that easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had my reservations. I still think Rhine Lab is too adventurous with regard to research into the Starpod. There are numerous potential risks that we have not fully considered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I also recognize that the stability I hope for may never come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the end of the day, it's the specific people in whom we place our trust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well then... thank you for your trust, Silence of the Scientific Ethics Consensus Committee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope what we're doing is worth it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it is. This station is a unique opportunity for the company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "In addition to the Starpod research, the low-Originium environment of Kjerag also offers a rare opportunity for biological research. Not to mention Maryam has wanted to visit Karlan for ages!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even Ferdinand came up with the proposal for the station's core power supply just two weeks after we got approval.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, he buried his head in his theoretical research right after that. Elena from Energy is handling the actual implementation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's hope our interactions with Kjerag go as smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glassdooropen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe there will be no need to worry about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The door to the observation station opens from the outside. The visitor flicks away the snow that has fallen on his shoulders and walks in."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We meet again, Mr. Edelweiss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a regular visit to see if you need anything for the construction of the station.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems like things are progressing quite smoothly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gnosis looks up at the bright lights installed on the spacious ceiling of the station."
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine Lab and Karlan Trade have worked together to build this little temple, sturdy and bright, in an astonishingly short period of time."
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to the houses of Kjerag, its bold, futuristic design might as well have come from another world."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Karlan Trade will do everything in our power to assist Rhine Lab's observation project, and provide any assistance necessary outside of the scope of work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as the terms agreed in the treaty are upheld, you will enjoy maximum freedom to conduct your activities in Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your generosity, Mr. Edelweiss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Research has always been the sole purpose of Rhine Lab. We have no reason to violate the treaty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course... I believe as much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such transnational cooperation is unprecedented in the history of Terra. It will undoubtedly produce its share of obstacles...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I simply wish to express that, as long as we proceed with due candor in the sharing of scientific information, we will be able to avoid the sort of accident that occurred in Trimounts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1031_slent2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I forgot to ask! Will the Saintess come and visit the station?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I expect she will attend the opening ceremony once the facility is complete... is there a particular reason why you hope to meet her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, nothing serious, I'm just a curious critter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "I kinda remember the Saintess wasn't too into our project, but then she flipped around and agreed, all of a sudden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just wanna know what made her change her mind, and I figured that'd be a chance to ask.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess has a very busy schedule. If you wish to meet her, you may want to attend some local ceremonies... if the fancy strikes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess and the Vine-Bead Court would be very happy to receive you... let me know if you have such intentions, and I'll make the necessary arrangements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, aren't you meticulous? You seem made for this job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm simply showing you proper Kjerag hospitality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's our mutual hope that this cooperation will be a fruitful one... free of trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Much appreciated. Our project wouldn't be going so smoothly without your help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would not call it help... we are simply trying to achieve the same goal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Karlan Trade will connect the mountains of Kjerag for you, paving the roads and providing the necessary freedom for your activities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "In turn, Rhine Lab will share data from your studies of our local ecology, and assist with medical development.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The contract details have to go between Director Fitzroy and Karlan Trade, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a researcher, not a diplomat. I just want you to know that Rhine Lab has come to this sacred place in good faith.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "On this, I think we are of the same mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "They shake hands with nods and smiles, an image that could have served as a perfect press photo."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no need to worry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will continue along as 'friends,' assuming we both abide by our agreement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
