    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2007_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The representatives of Karlan Trade are here, Elena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "They want to meet a representative of Rhine Lab as soon as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why? We don't have any scheduled meetings with Karlan Trade, do we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is it because of the Catastrophe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "They want to discuss the cause, and at least obtain the data observed by the station.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you see Carolin anywhere? She's supposed to be in charge of the observation data, isn't she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2007_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the other question I have for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one's seen her since yesterday morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Energy Section Researcher"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
