    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Men with guns surrounding the station, demanding that all our researchers gather in the lobby for 'questioning.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this how Karlan Trade treats its friends, Mr. Edelweiss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The researchers stand around the spacious lobby in small groups."
    },
    {
        "text": "Gnosis and the guards of Clan Silverash occupy the outside area near the door."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two groups stand opposite one another, as though separated by an invisible river."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a request, not a demand... and it seems that not all your researchers are accounted for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who exactly are you looking for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A researcher who was spotted in a restricted military zone of Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gnosis scans the faces of the researchers one by one."
    },
    {
        "text": "The strong guards stand silently while the researchers exchange wordless gazes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She is not here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems that Rhine Lab is not fully aware of your researchers' whereabouts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're accusing us of espionage, I'll ask that you submit your complaint through the official channels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are unable to cooperate with impromptu investigations like so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course... there is another reason why I'm here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you've heard about the Catastrophe that occurred within Kjerag's borders several hours ago, something that has never before happened in our history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Panic is spreading. The people's nerves are sensitive, and anything new may provoke a reaction... I'm sure you understand what I mean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should I trust that you're not one of the sensitive ones, Mr. Edelweiss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "My views on this matter, and Karlan Trade's views, are not important at this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is important is that the people want an explanation. I hope to work together with you to find the cause of this Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just checked the station's observation logs. There was nothing out of the ordinary in the seventy-two hours preceding the Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're telling me that the observation station did not detect anything abnormal leading up to the first Catastrophe to strike this land in a thousand years?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the truth, at least based on our observation data.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright. Mr. Edelweiss wants the truth. We'll give him the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The primary objective of this observation station is to study the Starpod.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Current research shows no relationship between the Starpod and Catastrophes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Similarly, any assertion that building an observation station here might bring Catastrophe to Kjerag is purely speculative with no basis in evidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(W-Wait a second, Elena! Now is not the time to be argumentative!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "May I be frank?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You may.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young woman's voice is calm, her gaze firm and unwavering."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't mince words, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "This may run contrary to the Kjerag faith, but from a scientific perspective, so-called 'sudden' Catastrophes are not an abnormal occurrence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is the peace and quiet that Kjerag has enjoyed for so long, and the attitude of taking it for granted, that is truly abnormal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The lobby is completely quiet. Elena's words echo to the end of the corridor."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When this observation station was first established, Rhine Lab considered adding a Catastrophe warning system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, we placed too much trust in past experience, and did not consider the installation of this system to be a priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we are to take remedial measures...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The real priority should be for Rhine Lab and Karlan Trade to go back to the negotiating table and establish an effective Catastrophe warning system in Kjerag as soon as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A most astute observation, Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "I agree completely. Karlan Trade will make developing a Catastrophe warning system a top priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "text": "We would like to obtain a copy of the station's observation data from the past month... may we expect your cooperation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "One moment, please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
