        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "38_g5_rhinelab_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't know you had it in you, Elena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Director Muelsyse... was I too hot-headed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A little bit... maybe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just angry at how science has to explain for perceptions that are completely unscientific, no matter where we are...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to recognize that science can be a very distant thing for a lot of people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people and the things that trouble us are part of this land. It's not something that we can ignore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like Silence said, 'Science is a clear, incisive look at every one of us.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... but this is just so absurd\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind that for now... let's get the data we need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Data, data... it's not like we'll find anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... this graph\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena picks up the scattered papers, and notices the shape of a certain curve on a spectrogram."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is impossible...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This machine is used to study the Starpod's structure, by bombarding it with high-powered particle beams and observing the resulting electromagnetic radiation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I just realized that the data obtained between 3-4 A.M. on December 7th is identical to the data from the same period on December 4th.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "An unusual coincidence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... it's impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how no two snowflakes are completely alike, atmospheric electromagnetic radiation is constantly changing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is only one possibility, if the exact same waveform is displayed during the same time period on two different days for an entire hour...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone altered these data.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_249_mlyss_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Falsifying data to support a hypothesis? But people don't usually pull shenanigans like that until way later in a project...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got any idea who might have done it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "December 7th... the day before the Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
